      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norton%2C_Massachusetts",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "When first settled in 1669, the area was called North Taunton, reflecting its position on Taunton’s northern border.",
